  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Agenda for the Future of Syria (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of the National Agenda for the Future of Syria will continue the work started in 2012, namely to engage Syrian stakeholders in the process of post-conflict transition by providing a forum for discussion on the strategic and logistical recovery and reconstruction needs of the country and promoting the necessary conditions for its implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
